    "App 内的语法讲解为原创内容，仅供学习参考；文字识别结果可能有误，请以原文为准。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grammar explanations in the app are original content for study reference only. Text recognition results may contain errors, so please rely on the original text."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las explicaciones gramaticales de la app son contenido original, solo como referencia de estudio. El reconocimiento de texto puede contener errores; confía en el texto original."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱 속 문법 설명은 직접 작성한 콘텐츠로 학습 참고용입니다. 텍스트 인식 결과는 틀릴 수 있으니 원문을 기준으로 해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App ထဲရှိ သဒ္ဒါရှင်းလင်းချက်များသည် မူလရေးသားထားသော အကြောင်းအရာဖြစ်ပြီး လေ့လာရန် ကိုးကားရုံသာ ဖြစ်ပါသည်။ စာသားဖတ်ယူမှု ရလဒ်တွင် အမှားပါနိုင်သဖြင့် မူရင်းစာသားကို အခြေခံပါ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phần giải thích ngữ pháp trong ứng dụng là nội dung tự biên soạn, chỉ để tham khảo khi học. Kết quả nhận dạng văn bản có thể sai, vui lòng lấy văn bản gốc làm chuẩn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 内的语法讲解为原创内容，仅供学习参考；文字识别结果可能有误，请以原文为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 內的語法講解為原創內容，僅供學習參考；文字識別結果可能有誤，請以原文為準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
