    "这些语法你看过，按遗忘曲线快要忘了，再看一眼吧。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've seen these before and, by the forgetting curve, they're about to slip away. Take another look."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya las viste, pero según la curva del olvido estás a punto de olvidarlas. Échales otro vistazo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "본 적 있는 문법이지만 망각 곡선상 곧 잊어버릴 때입니다. 한 번 더 보세요."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ဤသဒ္ဒါများကို ကြည့်ဖူးပြီး မေ့လျော့မှုမျဉ်းအရ မေ့တော့မည်ဖြစ်၍ နောက်တစ်ကြိမ် ကြည့်လိုက်ပါ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bạn đã xem những mẫu này, theo đường cong quên lãng thì sắp quên rồi. Xem lại một chút nhé."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些语法你看过，按遗忘曲线快要忘了，再看一眼吧。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些語法你看過，按遺忘曲線快要忘了，再看一眼吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台设备没有登录 iCloud，无法在 App 内直接提交": {
