    "遇到 bug、讲解有误或有任何建议，都可以附上截图告诉我们。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Found a bug, an error in an explanation, or have an idea? Tell us, screenshots welcome."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¿Un error, una explicación incorrecta o una idea? Cuéntanoslo, con capturas si quieres."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "버그나 설명 오류, 제안이 있으면 스크린샷과 함께 알려 주세요."
          }
        },
        "my": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ချို့ယွင်းချက်၊ ရှင်းလင်းချက် အမှား သို့မဟုတ် အကြံပြုချက် ရှိပါက ဖန်သားပြင်ဓာတ်ပုံနှင့်အတူ ပြောပြပါ။"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gặp lỗi, giải thích sai hay có góp ý? Hãy cho chúng tôi biết, có thể kèm ảnh chụp màn hình."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到 bug、讲解有误或有任何建议，都可以附上截图告诉我们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到 bug、講解有誤或有任何建議，都可以附上截圖告訴我們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
